# waze-issues

Read [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md) for full agent context. Short must-knows:

## Product

Phone reporter (Compose + floating overlay) → Nest/Postgres → WME userscript review. Prod: `https://waze-issues.ster.by`. No API key.

## Code ownership

- Shared reporting: `ReportController` via `WazeIssuesApp.reports` — used by full UI **and** bubble.
- `MainViewModel` is a thin wrapper only.
- Bubble: `android/.../bubble/` (`BubbleLauncher`, `BubbleOverlayService`, `BubbleOverlayContent`).
- Server reports: `server/src/reports/`. Userscript: `wme-waze-issues.user.js`.

## When changing Android

- Add UI strings to EN + RU + BE.
- Publishing APK: bump `versionCode` / `versionName` / `DEFAULT_APK_URL` together; build with `./android/build-apk.sh`.
- Prefer Docker builds; fix root-owned `android/.gradle` / `app/build` after Docker if local Gradle fails.
- Do not duplicate upload/GPS/trail logic outside `ReportController`.
- Overlay: never name a method `setPhase` beside `var phase by mutableStateOf`.

## Git / secrets

- No commit/push unless the user asks.
- Never commit keystores, `deploy/.env.prod`, DB URLs/passwords, or paste prod secrets into chat.
